# A on Control Tower F1's keyboard: ObjType_Events 7, loc_DAD4
# (ps2.asm:20054). "Here's a key board. Oh, here's some music, too.
# Shall I touch it?" ($1711), WinID_YesNo2; YES is a jump to where a
# Telepipe goes -- $C64C level, $C64E y, $C650 x -- with SXFID_Teleport
# waited out in place. NO: the box closes and nothing happens. Before
# build 73: $1708 and "... is not ported" on stderr.
#
# A new game on 47,27: $C64C-$C650 are the new game's, Paseo.

start level $3F 47 27
wait idle
press up
wait idle
press a
wait idle
expect script $1711
shot 01_keyboard
press c
wait idle
press down                   # NO
press c
wait idle
wait ticks 30
expect level $3F 47 27
press a
wait idle
expect script $1711
press c
wait idle
press c                      # YES
wait screen level
wait idle
expect level 4
shot 02_paseo
expect no-stderr not ported
